वि-√ स्फुर् (cf. वि-√ स्फर्) P. -स्फुरति, or -ष्फुरति (Pāṇ. viii, 3, 76), to dart asunder (intr.), RV.; ŚBr.;
to quiver, tremble, writhe, struggle, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to vibrate, flash, glitter, ib.;
to break forth, appear, Subh.; ŚārṅgS.

वि-√ स्फूर्ज् (incorrectly -स्फुर्ज्) P. -स्फूर्जति, to resound, thunder, roar, BhP.;
to snort, MBh.;
to break forth, appear, Kāv. :
Caus. -स्फूर्जयति, to cause to resound or twang (a bow), BhP.
